    {
      "id": "b66de4f4-3c6d-4fc4-8516-28c81dd41560",
      "title": "Escute as frases e observe o que continua igual antes de `libros`.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2f12ec25-9561-49e7-bbc6-02a026ad29ed",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute o mesmo grupo em duas cenas simples.</p><ul><li><strong>Hay unos libros en el estante.</strong></li><li><strong>Compré unos libros para la clase.</strong></li></ul><p>Em português: há uns livros na estante; eu comprei uns livros para a aula.</p><p>Nas duas frases, <strong>unos</strong> acompanha um substantivo masculino plural.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f79f9b95e3d6484b83063ccf283662e8_b07-unos-contexto.mp3?Expires=1794099425&Signature=LzuUQvsoZQ~1JBasvFbULNoxNXg0puUaEhN6iby~O7VOFbMNpzgZOj8ShaaYISahJDTIcnWty-DIxy~5OnbGuk3YnJRy572lsBRaMsTclbS5BorP-OgwgYe3DIz-MYiVNv2lRplNq5D~ruNxotf~TKIolsz-1VkAtzUb8o8SjTg4m71Id5Seojq0S3BZvHghEq7aFAu-3qx9duxOrgQtGwR8S3dhU4p7vliKI8EzGSX~O-qQdON4rocnOKeuoHwB9dxyvV60gVzP2XGSaVJ8InEovazl-wK6qHendOKs-sstJMpkrbjGvO3M6J5Vv4zB6FhZ3YdObhsHgLE5PYIkVQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
