    {
      "id": "2ae9639c-1d82-4cf9-9e46-c3a526321742",
      "title": "Observe a imagem, escute o áudio e note como a forma plural correspondente muda no feminino.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f4e101b0-4bb4-4f1e-96f3-84ce3b0ac90d",
          "textContent": "<p>Na nova cena, aparecem várias superfícies de apoio:</p><p><strong>unas mesas</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>umas mesas</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1d30fa730da14ca9a4113c457e5e1e13_b08-unas-mesas.png?Expires=1794099425&Signature=j8Rc5STFWFoEjY7GydDvu~t9ofDTfCBZ~NLVstNxkUFO-wdmY5kBXm484Hcs6o~rvSc2BK1C6HpChLByEodPcfpCnWu4kfgAywXXwxGcYmPyOBhJydCNPjkt9kCVT7dLNMPq9gX1PWY4I87ONRpqtTSfHzILHUMhlaW3B2rvtKJkzQLzmAj6aiMxlyx3~bX9VpcLhSktUZ8TKGBUiMEHYbts7Z-X7Wxccd0Ua83AAZwuSN0f6KzwDcSoG8YHxEmeinObYOeNgJJvaI33E8qQkJaP67m43SebFKUMFpnO~od7IK4dA4hSLkHad~Ndd9sU0Skhlmdjjnhoox0~5b6RGw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
