    {
      "id": "b4dd91f0-6eee-4d46-bee4-96572792e0be",
      "title": "Escute as frases e observe o que continua igual antes de `mesas`.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "712b968f-9901-41c4-a0d7-b8cc4cb5a4f0",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute o mesmo grupo em duas cenas simples.</p><ul><li><strong>Hay unas mesas al fondo.</strong></li><li><strong>Veo unas mesas libres.</strong></li></ul><p>Em português: há umas mesas ao fundo; eu vejo umas mesas livres.</p><p>Nas duas frases, <strong>unas</strong> acompanha um substantivo feminino plural.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8af875820ff34dc4b66daf6850d2eeee_b09-unas-contexto.mp3?Expires=1794099425&Signature=SKTbPBvUf1NGnMr9IpfYfB39JKiCymnRzcAQsKUAAg4VskfTywzoPN1ZbzT1QR2YEyfYgXEFhWCjYoWOLlygzNIaYTYpK-2xpJ1BE5sN9oQ9Ob~5HvsuY3n6zOuBfYZqMMGqGlWVSAwohwuo5Lzvc9-tfGQqnZrpItG-AZbZtyuwNMZ1ohko3AOkNB3c~OSsuuuhm97SrePwFVmix2dBzhp1IUI6r94i08QDfSlZqq82nGmQQ6c2WixG6H6L-VeQwY-pJ20kYAEpaKJKvH7BSBtLlh0iIL0395LrfGnImbSk9w1oUrbRQL4xlOMctHBJgPfw-Xm8gaCPXhrPzdBHfA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
